explain (costs off) (select a, sum(b) over (order by a rows 2 preceding) from window_t1 union all select a, b from window_t_rep) order by 1,2;
                                                     QUERY PLAN                                                      
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Sort
   Sort Key: window_t1.a, (sum(window_t1.b) OVER (ORDER BY window_t1.a USING = NULLS LAST ROWS 2::bigint PRECEDING))
   ->  Append
         ->  WindowAgg
               ->  Sort
